            responses: []
    - responseText: 'what are you doing here tonight '
      nextNode:
        dialogueText: "We\u2019re doing just fine today but I\u2019d rather be left
          alone with my wife to despise upcoming plans."
        responses:
        - responseText: ' Oh really? That sounds interesting, may you tell me what
            they are briefly?'
          nextNode:
            dialogueText: "Well\u2026 They involve something with mass destruction
              that will carnage the world\u2026"
            responses:
            - responseText: "\u2026 Well then... May I inquire on why you are doing
                this? And what are you possibly planning to do??"
              nextNode:
                dialogueText: " You Pig take everything so seriously (rich laugh)
                  ... Can I just enjoy my romantic dinner with my wife at peace without
                  this senseless mockery that I\u2019m receiving??!"
                responses:
                - responseText: " Okay then my bad, but I\u2019ll let you know that
                    I hope your plan fails just like the last one. (poor laugh)"
